usage: analyze_lean_parallel_verification.py [-h] --run RUN --inputs INPUTS
                                             --fresh FRESH --out OUT

Recompute the declared whole-corpus branch/snapshot comparison. Reads original
capture artifacts; never launches a verifier or changes a plan. Partial
conditions have no whole-run rate. Resource profiles and uninstrumented
performance remain separate. Missing candidate clocks are not inferred from
native operation duration or attributed to a verifier stage.

options:
  -h, --help       show this help message and exit
  --run RUN
  --inputs INPUTS
  --fresh FRESH
  --out OUT
